{"description":"In the heart of the Marais is a rare and perfect Parisian apartment inside a classified historic Palace with 4 lovely bedrooms and 3 bathrooms. Gracious living area and a dining room with a splendid table means that family groups or groups of friends can live in harmony together and live like Parisians.The spaceA magnificent 18th century palace on a quiet street in the beautiful, and now chic and trendy Marais district of Paris, offers a special apartment for fortunate guests. Enter through a high portal into a quiet and beautiful courtyard lined with boxed Magnolias. Then enter through a private door directly into the apartment. The light from the courtyard enters the apartment, but cunning glass French doors prevent any prying eyes from seeing inside, while the insiders have an unobstructed view of the courtyard. The large entry hall, lined with 18th century stone is still modern and welcoming, with planted lemon trees, interesting antiques from the owners' travels, and attractive paintings. Add to this every modern comfort. The apartment is on two floors with two separate living rooms. There are two master bedrooms on the entry floor each with its own modern bathroom, and one double and one with two twin beds, and its own sitting area, on the lower floor. The two floors are separated by a charming spiral staircase. There is a beautiful dining room which seats 10 easily, a nice kitchen, and much more.Please note there are no pets allowed.Other things to noteThis property includes access to a private chef (available at an additional cost). For privacy and security reasons, outside chef or catering services are not permitted.","amenities":[{"title":"Bath","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hairdryer","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Shampoo","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hot water","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Washing machine","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Tumble dryer","available":true,"subtitle":